1
00:00:00,196 --> 00:00:02,035
Today is Children's Day
今天是儿童节

2
00:00:02,036 --> 00:00:04,514
I wake up early and feel happy
我很早就醒了感觉很开心

3
00:00:04,516 --> 00:00:05,463
At school
在学校

4
00:00:05,716 --> 00:00:07,554
join my classmates in singing
和我的同学一起唱歌

5
00:00:07,556 --> 00:00:09,275
dancing, and playing games
跳舞，玩游戏

6
00:00:09,275 --> 00:00:11,063
Everyone laughs a lot
每个人都笑得很开心

7
00:00:11,275 --> 00:00:12,223
At noon
中午的时候

8
00:00:12,355 --> 00:00:14,702
we have a special lunch with delicious food
我们有一个特别的午餐有美味的食物

9
00:00:14,858 --> 00:00:15,599
After school
放学后

10
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:18,382
I go home and find many presents in the living room
我回家发现客厅里有许多礼物

11
00:00:18,515 --> 00:00:22,623
My mom and dad gave me toys and books 1 love
我爸爸妈妈给了我玩具和书1爱

12
00:00:23,155 --> 00:00:26,623
I quickly open each gift and feel very happy
我快速打开每个礼物，感到非常高兴

13
00:00:26,675 --> 00:00:28,343
The day goes by fast
一天过得很快

14
00:00:28,356 --> 00:00:30,463
This is a special Children's Day
这是一个特别的儿童节

15
00:00:30,475 --> 00:00:31,315
and I will
我会的。

16
00:00:31,315 --> 00:00:32,481
always remember it
永远记住它

